  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">The total revenue a high school makes from a play is T dollars. The revenue is made from selling tickets at $3.25 per child ticket, c,  and $7.50 for each adult ticket, a. Which equation is best to find the number of child tickets sold?</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
